'''Package Doge''' (ダンボールわんこ, ''Danbōru Wanko'', '''Cardboard Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].

