==Enemy==
This is a very weak enemy, intended for rewards stages. In fact, you could make a good case for this being one of the weakest enemies in the entire game, not only for its HP, but for its attack power, attack speed and the lack of movement. Take note that this is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy.

