==Trivia==
*Package Doge, [[Sunrise Doge]] and [[Ritual Drum Doge]] are the only stationary enemies in the game, due to the lack of movement speed.
*This enemy is a reference to the company [[:wikipedia:Amazon (company)|Amazon]], since the box has the word "wamazon" on the side of it.

